# Design system

Follow `context/DESIGN.md` and `context/SKILLS.md`.

On frontend work, also use the installed Emil Kowalski skills in `.agents/skills/` (`emil-design-eng`, `animate`, `review-animations`, and the rest of `npx skills add emilkowalski/skills`).

- Fonts: IBM Plex Sans + IBM Plex Mono only
- Default authenticated chrome: dark ink navy
- Primary signal: amber `#F5A524`, used sparingly
- Radius default 6px, never 16px+ cards
- Status = color dot + text label
- CSS variables only; no raw hex in components
- No Inter, Poppins, purple gradients, emoji icons, or bounce animations
- CrewPulse tokens win over skill defaults when they clash
